{"t":"An Interest In Botany Quest","s":"an-interest-in-botany-quest-3c6fa","k":"quest","i":"assets/wiki/An_Interest_In_Botany_Quest_Map_1_52decb.png","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">An Interest In Botany Quest</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aka\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">None.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"log\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Log</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Tibia%20Tales\">Tibia Tales</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvl\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0<br/>(50+ recommended)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.60<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">June 30, 2010<br/>Summer Update 2010</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Quests</nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-quest-legend\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Legend\">Legend</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Rabaz\">Rabaz</a> got an ambitious interest in plants, maybe you can help him out collecting some samples.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Farmine\">Farmine</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Zao%20Wailing%20Widow%20Cave\">Zao Wailing Widow Cave</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-dangers\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dangers\">Dangers</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Zao\">Zao</a> lesser creatures, <a href=\"#/wiki/Lancer%20Beetle\">Lancer Beetles</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Wailing%20Widow\">Wailing Widows</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-reward\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Reward\">Reward</span></h3>\n<p>1,000 gp, <a href=\"#/wiki/Sedge%20Hat\">Sedge Hat</a>, 3000 exp.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-spoiler\">\n<div class=\"tw-cmd showhide-visible showhide-init quest-spoiler\" data-command=\"showhide-content\" data-showhide-value=\"visible\">\n<div class=\"showhide-header\" data-showhide-element=\"header\">Click to show/hide the quest spoiler.<br/><span style=\"font-size: 0.8em;\">(settings)</span></div>\n<div class=\"showhide-body\" data-showhide-element=\"body\">\n<div class=\"spoiler-pretext\">Spoiler • edit</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Required_Equipment\">Required Equipment</span></h3>\n<ul><li>A <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Bug\">Fire Bug</a> or a Melee Weapon able to cut through <a href=\"#/wiki/Spider%20Web\">Spider Webs</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Obsidian%20Knife\">Obsidian Knife</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Rope\">Rope</a>, or equivalent</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Shovel\">Shovel</a>, or equivalent</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Levitate\">Levitate</a>, 6 <a href=\"#/wiki/Parcel\">Parcels</a> or equivalent.</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Method\">Method</span></h3>\n<dl><dd><i>Before even attempting it, please note that <b>this mission is not required to unlock the potion store</b>. The potion store will be unlocked by completing <a href=\"#/quest/the-new-frontier-quest\">The New Frontier Quest</a> only.</i></dd></dl>\n<p>Visit <a href=\"#/wiki/Rabaz\">Rabaz</a> in <a href=\"#/wiki/Farmine\">Farmine</a> and ask him for a <b>mission</b>. He needs you to collect samples from rare plant specimen in <a href=\"#/wiki/Zao\">Zao</a>. Go to the storage room to the west and receive the <a href=\"#/wiki/Botany%20Almanach\">Botany Almanach</a>. Make sure you have the <a href=\"#/wiki/Botany%20Almanach\">Botany Almanach</a> in your inventory before you continue.\n</p><p><br/>\nLeave <a href=\"#/wiki/Farmine\">Farmine</a> to the <a href=\"#/wiki/Zao%20Steppe\">Zao Steppes</a>. Find the small north-western <span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvTGFuY2VyX0JlZXRsZV9DYXZlP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\" title=\"Lancer Beetle Cave (page does not exist)\">Lancer Beetle Cave</span> and in it, the <a href=\"#/wiki/Giant%20Dreadcoil\">Giant Dreadcoil</a>. It's about half way through the cave, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33132,31396,8\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33132, 31396, 8)</a>. When you find it, use your <a href=\"#/wiki/Obsidian%20Knife\">Obsidian Knife</a> on it to obtain a sample. The samples do not exist as an item for you to confirm, so watch for the orange text that appears above your character.\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"0\" hash=\"aafa94b532c5e9e144e47807a3351b33\" id=\"w-gallery-0\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:153px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-An_Interest_In_Botany_Quest_Map_1-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:138px; width:185px; top:6.5px;\"><img alt=\"Lancer Beetle Cave entrance.\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\" entrance.\" height=\"151\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/An_Interest_In_Botany_Quest_Map_1_52decb.png\" style=\"\" title=\"An Interest In Botany Quest Map 1.png (23 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\"><span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvTGFuY2VyX0JlZXRsZV9DYXZlP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\" title=\"Lancer Beetle Cave (page does not exist)\">Lancer Beetle Cave</span> entrance.</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:153px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-An_Interest_In_Botany_Quest_Dreadcoil-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:151px; width:185px;\"><img alt=\"Giant Dreadcoil.\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\".\" height=\"151\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/An_Interest_In_Botany_Quest_Dreadcoil_5063b8.png\" style=\"\" title=\"An Interest In Botany Quest Dreadcoil.png (206 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Giant%20Dreadcoil\">Giant Dreadcoil</a>.</div></div></div>\n<p>Now you must find the second plant, a <a href=\"#/wiki/Giant%20Verminous\">Giant Verminous</a>. Go to the <a href=\"#/wiki/Zao%20Wailing%20Widow%20Cave\">Zao Wailing Widow Cave</a>, located slightly east of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Zao%20Orc%20Land\">Zao Orc Land</a> (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33223,31397,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33223, 31397, 7)</a>).\nInside it, go north-east to find <a href=\"#/wiki/Spider%20Web\">Spider Webs</a>. Use your <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Bug\">Fire Bug</a> or a melee weapon on the spider webs to cut through them. Now go north and follow the path north-west and then north-east to find a large pit. On the edge there is a <a href=\"#/wiki/Giant%20Verminous\">Giant Verminous</a>. Use your <a href=\"#/wiki/Obsidian%20Knife\">Obsidian Knife</a> on this plant and exit the cave. Note that there is a <a href=\"#/wiki/Giant%20Dreadcoil\">Giant Dreadcoil</a> very close to the giant verminous. You cannot use this dreadcoil.\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"1\" hash=\"4b057137fb0ff30176683d2505eac5a4\" id=\"w-gallery-1\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:175px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Zao_Wailing_Widow_Cave_Entrance-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:150px; width:185px; top:11.5px;\"><img alt=\"Zao Wailing Widow Cave entrace.\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\" entrace.\" height=\"173\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Zao_Wailing_Widow_Cave_Entrance_405516.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Zao Wailing Widow Cave Entrance.png (12 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Zao%20Wailing%20Widow%20Cave\">Zao Wailing Widow Cave</a> entrace.</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:175px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-An_Interest_In_Botany_Quest_Map_3-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:173px; width:156px;\"><img alt=\"Route to Giant Verminous\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Route to \" height=\"173\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/An_Interest_In_Botany_Quest_Map_3_26e770.png\" style=\"\" title=\"An Interest In Botany Quest Map 3.png (3 KB)\" width=\"156\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Route to <a href=\"#/wiki/Giant%20Verminous\">Giant Verminous</a></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:175px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-An_Interest_In_Botany_Quest_Verminous-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:150px; width:185px; top:11.5px;\"><img alt=\"Giant Verminous\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"\" height=\"173\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/An_Interest_In_Botany_Quest_Verminous_ca1d7d.png\" style=\"\" title=\"An Interest In Botany Quest Verminous.png (211 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Giant%20Verminous\">Giant Verminous</a></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:175px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-An_Interest_In_Botany_Quest_Plant_1-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:166px; width:185px; top:3.5px;\"><img alt=\"Orange message.\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Orange message.\" height=\"173\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/An_Interest_In_Botany_Quest_Plant_1_48b93a.png\" style=\"\" title=\"An Interest In Botany Quest Plant 1.png (581 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Orange message.</div></div></div>\n<p>Now go back to <a href=\"#/wiki/Rabaz\">Rabaz</a> and turn in your <b>mission</b> to claim your <a href=\"#/wiki/Sedge%20Hat\">Sedge Hat</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Transcripts\">Transcripts</span></h2>\n<p>Accepting the mission\n</p>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>mission</b><br/>\nRabaz: Why yes, there is indeed some minor issue I could need your help with. I was always a friend of nature and it was not recently I discovered the joys of plants, growths, of all the flora around us. ...<br/>\nRabaz: <b>Botany</b> my friend. The study of plants is of great importance for our future. Many of the potions we often depend on are made of plants you know. Plants can help us tending our wounds, cure us from illness or injury. ...<br/>\nRabaz: I am currently writing an excessive compilation of all the knowledge I have gathered during my time here in <b>Farmine</b> and soon hope to publish it as 'Rabaz' Unabridged <b>Almanach</b> Of Botany'. ...<br/>\nRabaz: However, to actually complete my botanical epitome concerning Zao, I would need someone to enter these dangerous lands. Someone able to get closer to the specimens than I can. ...<br/>\nRabaz: And this is where you come in. There are two extremely rare species I need samples from. Typically not easy to come by but it should not be necessary to venture too far into Zao to find them. ...<br/>\nRabaz: Explore the anterior outskirts of Zao, use my <b>almanach</b> and find the two specimens with missing samples on their pages. The <b>almanach</b> can be found in a chest in my storage, next to my shop. It's the door over there. ...<br/>\nRabaz: If you lose it I will have to write a new one and put it in there again - which will undoubtedly take me a while. So keep an eye on it on your travels. ...<br/>\nRabaz: Once you find what I need, best use a knife to carefully cut and gather a leaf or a scrap of their integument and press it directly under their appropriate entry into my botanical <b>almanach</b>. ...<br/>\nRabaz: Simply return to me after you have done that and we will discuss your reward. What do you say, are you in?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>yes</b><br/>\nRabaz: Yes? Yes! That's the enthusiasm I need! Remember to bring a sharp knife to gather the samples, plants - even mutated deformed plants - are very sensitive you know. Off you go and be careful out there, Zao is no place for the faint hearted mind you.\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">An Interest In Botany Quest</strong></span>\n</p><p>Completing the mission\n</p>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>mission</b><br/>\nRabaz: Well fantastic work, you gathered both samples! Now I can continue my work on the <b>almanach</b>, thank you very much for your help indeed. Can I take a look at my book please?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>yes</b><br/>\nRabaz: Ah, thank you. Now look at that texture and fine colour, simply marvellous. ...<br/>\nRabaz: I hope the sun in the steppe did not exhaust you too much? Shellshock. A dangerous foe in the world of field science and exploration. ...<br/>\nRabaz: Here, I always wore this comfortable hat when travelling, take it. It may be of use for you on further reconnaissances in Zao. Again you have my thanks, friend.\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">An Interest In Botany Quest</strong></span>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<div class=\"messagebox\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Go Forward Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"25\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Go_Forward_Icon_f12cec.png\" width=\"25\"/></span><figcaption></figcaption></figure><p style=\"font-weight: bold;\">See also:</p><br/><p><a href=\"#/wiki/Tibia%20Tales\">Tibia Tales</a></p></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div></div></div>","quests":["wayfarer-outfits-quest"]}